    {
      "text": "$1$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$1000$",
      "image": ""
    }
  ],
  "answer": "B",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "Series: $R_s = 10R$, so $I_s = \\dfrac{E}{10R}$.\n\nParallel: $R_p = \\dfrac{R}{10}$, so $I_p = \\dfrac{10E}{R}$.\n\n$$n = \\frac{I_p}{I_s} = 100$$",
